      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa0802e6df0a8b8f0ca9453b0c3842b71d769b133f3a95834be2da1b6e7a2527",
      "text": "Patterns of Work",
      "hash": "451912cbee5f0ec6ab7874916ee61c5d7d98c7c960493b524130e6c14b3e3f92"
    },
    {
      "id": "90d6607f99588859a0a91828ff1cb5f766ff9091112fcc6e4a4c6ae989a7ba97",
      "text": "Human-in-the-loop",
      "hash": "014893d767fb10c9f698bbc84894647de33135dacd220fcf7b22451b55c64e6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b9ae735019be0fed4b1322757fcd53530f09d0489a715c32284bfbe86c9e482",
      "text": "A working pattern where one or more humans pair with the agent during a session — reviewing, redirecting, or collaborating in real time.",
      "hash": "593c90053375caa00c552ed91158b359f1f6e475990e0c1098b7d1c2418d65d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "21cf2992fcb02d8a2a95684433d062050b37d904aa46c9213f790ca3216fcdc3",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac559cb7133b028d6809e20c6d1ea4a372faa0fe62f54e541b6dfa6abd263e0f",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "139fc8131d005a8e9b2e4335f304953dffb692a925e704398e0ea3209ad3c34f",
      "text": "A working pattern where one or more humans pair with the",
      "hash": "c56cb803c35efef0355dac67a074c91e52eebc71bbceea5cb88defa44e105e6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "0be1f985931a40c86827b557ba038a04b2f77526fac0449d79af5d371c391335",
      "text": "during a",
      "hash": "fae795a2f55132feba60ef01e1af91453508aa5ecb34de455b31270e8a063cbd"
    },
    {
      "id": "f35c13a91b62f7ac3c309ac0d1847236e7daab64c2019162b128b89dad3786b5",
      "text": "— reviewing, redirecting, or collaborating in real time. The human is present and engaged, not just gating individual actions.",
      "hash": "73db2db9df043327adb37a650c40f578c5ac60d925a60a2ec08ec3adf9c1f5d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3401bd0588cdf1de72ef65a382a244def37985fbe9d366f5566ee25cd2d4a9b",
      "text": "The contrast is with",
      "hash": "e23bf039f6070e516ecfd68d15fd7c314ab863181f13e494a6d1f9f347cc7664"
    },
    {
      "id": "d55340b999d9377245d28691381f08a1c4b0c9a131719f39e3854ca817797ac5",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "5bbdb496b0f86a639cd5975a94d0802de3960ba2f897bf9f2f723ef0f5f6f671",
      "text": "work, where the agent runs unattended and you judge the result afterwards. Human-in-the-loop means catching problems while they're still cheap: you see the agent reach for the wrong file, misread the requirement, or start down a dead end, and you redirect it in one sentence — rather than discovering twenty minutes of confident work built on that mistake. Agents don't reliably know when they're off track; left alone, they tend to push forward rather than stop and ask.",
      "hash": "c7d9e9928af1aa026a1380afd8751e947ec32b708fe130cb6307ce32ec719b90"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9e1feff16ba45543cae32590735c38af7c9dbfec59ad2dfdd528396359b56b4",
      "text": "Which pattern fits depends on the work. Well-specified, low-risk, easy-to-verify tasks suit AFK. Tasks that are ambiguous, irreversible, or where you'd struggle to review the finished result — a schema migration, a tricky design decision, anything touching production — suit staying in the loop. The judgement call is essentially: how expensive is a wrong turn, and how late would you catch it?",
      "hash": "fb005cdb834c1728df1592d968035d5badc93c3952f0a998a645e1c32c18e18a"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a201e859754d4dbcc00774e0e7ec011026eba54bb112132d7f9c7d86e795aaf",
      "text": "Some work is in-the-loop by nature, because your reactions are the input.",
      "hash": "b4cea2dc7075a632034839750070185fdd146e2081828b9980f37bb5fe24235a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9eafccd3a0df0b3e4b2eb6fbb98d3ea1ae4c133901a7fd742ab2842648b7c60",
      "text": "Grilling",
      "hash": "78318482b2ed0e5dd1aa46addef2c3b1c379b1f3b213eac3337b8fe2b40ab6aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "63d31741aa163c67934bd1a5423f88da7575a99758e63e085538bd20786c70ce",
      "text": "only works with you there to answer the questions;",
      "hash": "878449ee465f040dabf68417e9a08e355451b97c02f607cd00f0a899163f40c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1df6219557ec587498085ed64cc3de2bb3ae0d5cac9c364023fc92bee88e8a50",
      "text": "only works with you there to react to the artifact.",
      "hash": "a5e95661ab827c4c8d76ba1100f84ba84a25f90cf36b91e390659b7d14ea93c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a29ae8ad6e4c526107b1dc77452ec091b50da52d1c2ea917e945d5b9c59c6eb2",
      "text": "Staying in the loop costs your attention, which is the scarce resource. Part of getting better with agents is moving more work safely out of the loop — with plans,",
      "hash": "a3891d6b57192858f681324dbf6ca1b531aaef5d931e05e24dd9d67f7ea86fb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ad106a86fa79e27b703db07d33ef1cb0fd479646a9e4ff647cb857431b6be3e",
      "text": "automated checks",
      "hash": "f748d6acc6e10f9e80812a46b239b1d2f3f145075600d299b6e40632fb06622b"
    },
    {
      "id": "4aacc09c7ce8076dfa3b4532362f926b776e37ae93ea7ca50fe0d8da906a9850",
      "text": ", and",
      "hash": "4aa9bfd2f175a94ad5a7cb321e1aea9790c73eb366a3415b47a00aeaa9fbf24a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e94ffe14caa9cccb67328ba8b83e3c0398b9f331a1a6b0532101652f98f06e28",
      "text": "human review",
      "hash": "978a8b09ee5844e15ea0661d83702e00e6b4312de7dae44479adf0e8d7f5262b"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c798ae07794828939840db837f26020a84d03442cfe96b9fc2b02340306e5d2",
      "text": "at the end instead of supervision throughout.",
      "hash": "87b8cdddd4fd18ef9a316f641b2fc1a26563bf8524acec4d8ea31c614390d342"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3ee8093667c096ae03b9b3976cfe678953c79f7117daedb1381ba0af2e72f19",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "075a31bad87a67aef1445de99ce533a87f133355da91037773efe91a2b80d735",
      "text": "\"Run this AFK overnight?\"",
      "hash": "3568704901596efe6fe0c3c4c7a0bc50694df1780c3f83432a337a9fd8cbde88"
    },
    {
      "id": "69e7389698080c6deb0419a596572012506150116b6c5f45c420d9971f8655ec",
      "text": "\"No, schema migration — keep it human-in-the-loop. I want to see each step and steer if it picks the wrong column to backfill from.\"",
      "hash": "18d3e332ca574cc93500c4e2df9c26dea703e532345794c13ab7df0662139c7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6f6dd02a1350418426d1f0f4b68c48f13f1de87b655fc33993fa0cb9147911e",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "af38b01c6d20156591304f1291b8e7dfa8ac6749f1b6c94be580c316229db8c6",
      "text": "Subagent",
      "hash": "d6cb4188b8fa57aae3e4ca3a1210c9afe7ca995375c2fb36d90a1fa73529a44e"
    },
    {
      "id": "025c535008c7c0184e8542e2082c64c08ee1784acc364dbfeca0004b581d2154",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "d36bf2fff58ecce440b32886a175f6963d9ffe6a79a5964944519771ce61fbf4",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
